Kalandra is a fresh continuation of the Clio language project by Pouya Eghbali and contributors.
Clio: https://github.com/clio-lang/clio

The initial website scaffold and supporting card components come from Tiramisu Docs (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/pouya-eghbali/tiramisu-docs
Scaffold source revision: c5a3ca2b59f7845a75d9de38a4cfa4cf8763315a

The retired, separate Kalandra implementation is not used in this project.

The syntax port and reference fixtures derive from committed Clio (Apache-2.0),
revision 75c7c09e962ef15506ff9bc7cf856aad727436c5. Original generated-JavaScript
expectations are retained in tests/fixtures/clio/corpus.json.

The range, slice, format, decorator, and type-marker compatibility helpers derive from that same Clio
revision. Original helper sources are retained in tests/fixtures/clio/runtime.json;
the standalone emission template lives in packages/compiler/src/emitter/helpers.ts.
